chapter.v:
Jerusalem and 


the cities, 


of Judah, its kings and officials, to make them a desolation and a waste, a hissing and a curse, as at this day;

and all 


the mixed, 


tribes among them; all the kings of the land of Uz and all the kings of the land of the Philistines (Ashkelon, Gaza, Ekron, and the remnant of Ashdod);

Edom, Moab, 


and the, 


sons of Ammon;

all the 


kings of, 


Tyre, all the kings of Sidon, and the kings of the coastland across the sea;

Dedan, Tema, 


Buz, and, 


all who cut the corners of their hair;

all the 


kings of, 


Arabia and all the kings of the mixed tribes who dwell in the desert;

all the 


kings of, 


Zimri, all the kings of Elam, and all the kings of Media;
